INSERT INTO `jobs` VALUES (15,14442,'Ai Engineer ','Strata One','Gurugram','full-time','$80000-$100000','Research And Development ','senior','Strata One is seeking a Senior AI Engineer to join our dynamic Research and Development team in Gurugram. In this pivotal role, you will leverage your expertise in artificial intelligence to design and implement cutting-edge AI solutions that drive innovation and efficiency across various projects. You will collaborate closely with cross-functional teams, utilizing advanced algorithms and machine learning techniques to develop scalable models that can handle complex data sets and deliver meaningful insights. As a key member of our team, you will have the opportunity to shape the future of AI technology and contribute to significant advancements in our products and services.\n\nAt Strata One, we believe in fostering a collaborative and creative environment where your ideas can flourish. You will be working alongside some of the brightest minds in the industry, tackling challenging problems and pushing the boundaries of technology. If you are passionate about AI and are looking for a role that not only challenges you but also allows you to make a real impact, then Strata One is the place for you. Join us in our mission to revolutionize the industry through innovative AI solutions and be part of a company that values your contributions and supports your professional growth.','• Master\'s or Ph.D. degree in Computer Science, AI, or a related field\n• Minimum of 5 years of relevant experience in AI and machine learning\n• Proficiency in programming languages such as Python, Java, or C++\n• Strong understanding of neural networks, deep learning frameworks, and natural language processing\n• Experience with data analysis tools and frameworks (e.g., TensorFlow, PyTorch, Keras)\n• Excellent problem-solving skills and ability to work under pressure\n• Strong communication skills, with the ability to convey complex ideas clearly\n• Proven ability to work collaboratively in a team-oriented environment','• Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses\n• Comprehensive health insurance and wellness programs\n• Opportunities for professional development and continuous learning\n• Flexible working hours and a supportive work-life balance\n• Access to cutting-edge tools and technologies\n• Engaging team events and a positive workplace culture\n• The chance to work on innovative projects that shape the future of AI','2026-03-25 00:00:00',0,'[]','active','medium','onsite','30days','{\"phoneRequired\": true, \"customQuestions\": [{\"id\": \"1772008374560\", \"question\": \"How may years of experience do you have in Ai\"}], \"coverLetterRequired\": true}','2026-02-25 08:33:08','2026-02-25 08:33:08'),(16,29137,'Full-Stack Developer','Claude','Gurgaon, Delhi NCR','part-time','780000-88000','Engineer','entry','Join Claude as a Full-Stack Developer and immerse yourself in an innovative environment where creativity meets technology! As a part-time entry-level developer based in Gurgaon, Delhi NCR, you will have the opportunity to work on exciting projects that challenge your skills and expand your knowledge. You will collaborate with a dynamic engineering team, contributing to both front-end and back-end development while learning best practices in software design and architecture.\n\nIn this role, you will be involved in building user-friendly web applications, integrating APIs, and ensuring optimal performance across devices. Your contributions will directly impact our products and enhance user experience. At Claude, we value fresh perspectives, and your input will be crucial as we strive to create cutting-edge solutions that resonate with our users.\n\nJoining Claude means becoming part of a forward-thinking company that prioritizes growth and innovation. We offer an environment that encourages you to learn, develop new skills, and advance your career in technology. If you are passionate about coding and eager to make a meaningful impact in a supportive team, we would love to hear from you!','• Bachelor\'s degree in Computer Science or a related field\n• Familiarity with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and relevant frameworks\n• Basic knowledge of back-end technologies such as Node.js or Python\n• Understanding of database management (SQL or NoSQL)\n• Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail\n• Excellent communication and teamwork abilities\n• Willingness to learn and adapt in a fast-paced environment\n• Experience with version control systems like Git is a plus','• Flexible work hours to accommodate your schedule\n• Opportunity to work in a vibrant, collaborative environment\n• Hands-on experience with the latest technologies and tools\n• Mentorship from experienced professionals in the industry\n• Potential for career advancement within the company\n• Access to training resources and workshops\n• Competitive compensation for part-time work',NULL,0,'[\"react\", \"node.js\"]','active','medium','onsite','30days','{\"phoneRequired\": false, \"customQuestions\": [], \"coverLetterRequired\": false}','2026-02-25 10:22:41','2026-02-25 10:22:41'),(17,12335,'Senior Backend Developer','TechVision Solutions','Hyderabad, Telangana','full-time','8,00,000','Tech','mid','TechVision Solutions is seeking a highly skilled Senior Backend Developer to join our dynamic Tech team. In this role, you will be responsible for designing, implementing, and maintaining scalable backend systems that power our innovative products. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure seamless integration and performance, while also taking part in architectural decisions that shape the future of our platform. Your expertise will help us enhance our existing systems and drive new initiatives that can take our solutions to the next level.\n\nAs a Senior Backend Developer, you will have the opportunity to work with cutting-edge technologies and methodologies in a fully remote environment. Your contributions will directly impact the user experience and overall success of our applications. Join TechVision Solutions and be part of a forward-thinking company that values creativity, collaboration, and continuous improvement. Here, you will not only grow your skills but also make a tangible difference in the tech landscape.\n\nIf you are passionate about backend development and are looking for a place where you can thrive, TechVision Solutions is the perfect fit. We believe in empowering our employees, fostering a culture of innovation, and providing the tools necessary for you to excel. We are excited to welcome a new team member who shares our vision and is ready to make an impact.','• Bachelor\'s degree in Computer Science or related field\n• 4+ years of professional experience in backend development\n• Proficiency in languages such as Java, Python, or Node.js\n• Experience with RESTful APIs and microservices architecture\n• Familiarity with database technologies like PostgreSQL, MongoDB, or MySQL\n• Strong understanding of version control systems, particularly Git\n• Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail\n• Ability to work collaboratively in a remote team environment','• Competitive salary and performance-based bonuses\n• Flexible work hours and remote work options\n• Professional development opportunities and access to online courses\n• Generous paid time off and holiday leave\n• Health and wellness programs\n• Collaborative and inclusive company culture\n• Opportunity to work with cutting-edge technologies','2026-03-31 00:00:00',1,'[\"Node.js\", \"MySQL\", \"REST API\", \"Express.js\", \"Redis\", \"Golang\", \"PostgreSQL\"]','active','medium','remote','10days','{\"phoneRequired\": true, \"customQuestions\": [{\"id\": \"17732919377050\", \"question\": \"Can you describe a challenging performance issue you encountered in a backend application and how you resolved it?\"}, {\"id\": \"17732919377051\", \"question\": \"What strategies do you use to ensure your API design is both scalable and maintainable, and can you provide an example from your past work?\"}, {\"id\": \"17732919377052\", \"question\": \"Tell us about a time when you had to integrate with a third-party service. What challenges did you face and how did you overcome them?\"}, {\"id\": \"17732919377053\", \"question\": \"How do you approach database schema design in a way that supports future changes and scalability? Please provide an example of a schema you designed.\"}, {\"id\": \"17732919377054\", \"question\": \"Describe a situation where you had to work with cross-functional teams to deliver a backend solution. How did you ensure effective communication and collaboration?\"}], \"coverLetterRequired\": true}','2026-03-12 05:05:43','2026-03-12 05:05:43');
